div#imPageRow_1.imPageRow
  div#imPageRowContent_1.imContentDataContainer
    .im-hero
      .im-hero__main
        h1.myh
          | Invitation for Russian visa online
        .mb-12px
          b.im-hero__lead
            | Easy way to get it in 2 clicks for
          a.btn.blue.ml-8px.font-20px.bold.border-white href="#pricing"
            = raw default_price(currency: @currency, tariff: @tariff)
        p.im-hero__text
          | Our company's Russian letter of invitation just for
          b.im-hero__price.ml-4px.mr-4px
            = raw default_price(currency: @currency, tariff: @tariff)
          | which consists of
          b.ml-4px.mr-4px
            | tourist confirmation
          | and
          b.ml-4px
            | tourist voucher
          |, the documents required to apply for a Russian tourist visa.
        p.im-hero__text
          | Russvisa is a private consulting agency, not affiliated with any government or embassy, and is listed in the official registry of tour operators.
        a.btn.blue.big.border-white href="#invitationForm"
          | GET INVITATION ONLINE
      / Блок страховки по макету заказчика: $1.35/день на индийской странице, $2 — на остальных.
      aside.im-hero__side
        .im-ins-card
          .im-ins-card__head
            svg.im-ins-card__icon viewBox="0 0 48 56" width="40" height="46" aria-hidden="true"
              path d="M24 2 4 9v16c0 13.5 8.6 24.6 20 29 11.4-4.4 20-15.5 20-29V9L24 2z" fill="#1d6fd8"
              path d="M20 18h8v8h8v8h-8v8h-8v-8h-8v-8h8z" fill="#fff"
            .im-ins-card__label INSURANCE
          h2.im-ins-card__title
            | Medical Insurance for Russia
            span.im-ins-card__online Online
          .im-ins-card__price = insurance_rate_label
          p.im-ins-card__text
            | Official health insurance policy fully functional inside Russia. Meets all consular requirements.
          a.im-ins-card__btn href="/insurance"
            | GET INSURANCE ONLINE &rarr;
